surd(27*{m^3},3) => ERR {"error":"function"}
surd(8*{L},3) | c:m => ERR {"error":"function"}
(27*{m^3})^(1/3) => =  3 | m | dim m1  
sqrt(4*{m^2}) => =  2 | m | dim m1  
sqrt(0*{m}^2+1*{s}^2) => ERR {"error":"function"}
abs(0*{m}+1*{s}) => ERR {"error":"function"}
1*{m}+1*{s} => ERR {"error":"dimension","dims":["m1","s1"]}
sqrt(1*{m}^2+1*{s}^2) => ERR {"error":"function"}
